10 REM Eight-fold kaleidoscope - Mode 0, cycling inks
20 MODE 0
30 FOR I=0 TO 15:INK I,I:NEXT
40 BORDER 0
50 XC=320:YC=200
60 C=1
70 X=INT(RND*260):Y=INT(RND*160)
80 PLOT XC+X,YC+Y,C:PLOT XC-X,YC+Y,C
90 PLOT XC+X,YC-Y,C:PLOT XC-X,YC-Y,C
100 PLOT XC+Y,YC+X,C:PLOT XC-Y,YC+X,C
110 PLOT XC+Y,YC-X,C:PLOT XC-Y,YC-X,C
120 C=C+1:IF C>15 THEN C=1
130 GOTO 70
